  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b6dffaeb1f6b7ca4cb5ce48f87980a3a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArenaHintZone
  title: 'JOB 1: THE CRATE'
  body: 'GOAL: bring the heavy crate to the glowing ring in the west. A wall is in
    the way, so the troops will go round it.

    HOW: stand next to the crate and
    tap left-click 3 times (one troop each). The number counts down 3, 2, 1, 0. At
    0 it moves by itself. More troops carry it faster. To steer it yourself, press
    Z (it freezes), hold LEFT + RIGHT and sweep, then press X to let it continue.

    RESULT:
    at the ring it shows Placed and a supply drop (gear and gold) appears.'
  radius: 4
